Biraz daha düşünce $322&#x27;ye gelince 50% TP alacağım. Duruma göre confirmation ile birlikte tamamen kapatıp kısa vadeli bir long düşüncesine geçebilirim.

Ama asıl alım düşündüğüm yerler $260 ve çevresi</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2045260715418947658/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1942" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5r7wW4AE5BEi?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5r7wW4AE5BEi?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5r7wW4AE5BEi?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5r7wW4AE5BEi?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/2045260715418947658/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2045260715418947658/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="3144" height="1740" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5tUIXMAAj981?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5tUIXMAAj981?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5tUIXMAAj981?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGI5tUIXMAAj981?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-w